WEBVTT

00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:06.820
8 years ago

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:10.560
Oh look, it's a shooting star!

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:13.540
You're right. That was a big one, wasn't it?

00:00:14.610 --> 00:00:15.700
What are you doing?

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:18.280
I'm wishing on that shooting star...

00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:21.820
...I'm asking it to send us a child of our own...

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:23.070
I see.

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:46.330
Is that a North Pole Lion?

00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:52.270
Come on, or we'll be eaten!

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:53.110
Wait!

00:01:00.190 --> 00:01:02.850
He's got a baby in his mouth!

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:04.960
Hey, hey, wait!

00:01:20.310 --> 00:01:25.870
On this day 8 years ago, a child was delivered into the arms of the Amamis.

00:01:26.150 --> 00:01:30.740
Who knew that one day he would hold the key to life or death for mankind?

00:01:30.920 --> 00:01:36.520
At the time, there wasn't a person on Earth who had an inkling.

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:42.200
Ga-Ga-Ga Ga-Ga-Ga GaoGaiGar

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:45.100
Ga-Ga-Ga Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga GaoGaiGar

00:01:52.450 --> 00:01:56.100
Rise in fury, Steel Cyborg!

00:01:58.220 --> 00:02:02.820
With your red mane and golden arms!

00:02:04.140 --> 00:02:07.100
Your G-Stone sparkling in the sun...

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:12.020
All the world's hope is in your hands.

00:02:12.020 --> 00:02:15.940
Your time has come to make a stand!

00:02:15.940 --> 00:02:18.740
Crushing the hopes of the people...

00:02:18.740 --> 00:02:22.500
The Zonders will pay the price!

00:02:24.650 --> 00:02:27.500
Ga-Ga-Ga Ga-Ga-Ga GaoGaiGar

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:30.670
Ga-Ga-Ga Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga GaoGaiGar

00:02:30.670 --> 00:02:33.210
Final Fusion, approved!

00:02:33.410 --> 00:02:36.340
Now transform into a superhero!

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:39.300
Warping dimensional space!

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:43.380
Dividing Driver!

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:51.020
A miracle! A mystery! The truth! A dream!

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:56.900
A gigantic, invincible guardian is born!

00:02:56.900 --> 00:02:59.850
Our very own King of Braves!

00:02:59.850 --> 00:03:03.740
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga GaoGaiGar

00:03:03.310 --> 00:03:05.800
This is the story of the brave men and women...

00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:08.750
...who fight with all their hearts to save mankind.

00:03:11.170 --> 00:03:11.210
Birth of the King of Braves!

00:03:12.260 --> 00:03:14.500
<i>Birth of the King of Braves!</i>

00:03:19.180 --> 00:03:22.060
The 21st Century

00:03:20.290 --> 00:03:21.990
The 21st century...

00:03:22.230 --> 00:03:26.930
There is no refuge to be found from Cities overrun with goods and people.

00:03:28.730 --> 00:03:32.930
Beneath the facade of this peaceful illusion...

00:03:33.070 --> 00:03:37.200
...the most powerful enemy ever to confront mankind, an evil...

00:03:37.340 --> 00:03:39.610
...beyond imagination has begun to stir.

00:03:40.810 --> 00:03:43.280
Faint-hearted ones...

00:03:43.380 --> 00:03:46.280
I shall endow you with my power.

00:03:46.750 --> 00:03:50.690
The world is so flooded with garbage that no matter how often we recycle...

00:03:50.820 --> 00:03:52.790
...we just can't keep pace.

00:03:53.030 --> 00:03:55.190
We've come here today to Garbage Island...

00:03:55.290 --> 00:03:57.560
...to observe the glut of trash discarded here...

00:03:57.700 --> 00:04:00.320
...and consider how we can more effectively use our limited resources.

00:04:01.070 --> 00:04:03.400
I-I want you to think it over, children...

00:04:03.540 --> 00:04:06.270
Y-You'll be turning in reports on the subject later.

00:04:07.410 --> 00:04:09.370
All right, then, try not to get hurt...

00:04:09.480 --> 00:04:10.970
You're on your own now!

00:04:15.010 --> 00:04:19.250
I can't believe someone would toss a 2002 flat-panel wall TV already.

00:04:19.350 --> 00:04:20.750
What a waste!

00:04:20.850 --> 00:04:24.220
Hey, cool! This MD player still works.

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:25.580
Ugh! This place stinks!

00:04:25.690 --> 00:04:27.160
I want to go home!

00:04:27.330 --> 00:04:29.520
How could they throw this away when it's not even broken?

00:04:29.630 --> 00:04:31.990
They shouldn't have bought it in the first place!

00:04:38.440 --> 00:04:39.340
Huh?

00:04:40.370 --> 00:04:41.840
What was that?

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:44.170
I'm getting a really bad feeling...

00:05:07.530 --> 00:05:08.690
Teacher!

00:05:08.830 --> 00:05:10.800
You nearly gave me a heart attack!

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:50.830
Oh, no! Galeon's on the move!

00:05:50.980 --> 00:05:51.770
What's that?

00:05:52.440 --> 00:05:54.210
Quick, call an emergency meeting!

00:05:57.350 --> 00:05:59.010
Is something the matter, Mr. President?

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:00.780
Hmm? No...

00:06:03.520 --> 00:06:04.610
Galeon?

00:06:05.060 --> 00:06:07.390
Look, I have an emergency to take care of.

00:06:07.490 --> 00:06:08.520
I'm leaving you in charge.

00:06:08.630 --> 00:06:09.290
Yes, sir.

00:06:11.060 --> 00:06:13.190
All right, Sakura. I'll see you later.

00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:15.130
Yes, Mr. President.

00:06:29.620 --> 00:06:30.780
Professor!

00:06:30.920 --> 00:06:33.650
It's too dangerous! Please come down now!

00:06:34.190 --> 00:06:37.640
Oh, quit nagging! I told you I'll be fine.

00:06:40.860 --> 00:06:41.990
What's this?

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:43.930
I'd better get a move on!

00:06:55.010 --> 00:06:56.870
The Space Development Corporation...

00:06:57.280 --> 00:07:01.580
Located in the heart of G Island City, a new city complex built in Tokyo Bay...

00:07:01.680 --> 00:07:04.620
...it serves as headquarters for the space technology giant.

00:07:04.850 --> 00:07:09.010
Beneath its public front, a world-class defense organization lies hidden...

00:07:09.150 --> 00:07:13.780
...at the bottom of the ocean, unknown to the rest of us.

00:07:16.130 --> 00:07:20.290
It is called the Gutsy Geoid Guard, alias GGG.

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:25.030
The organization GGG, armed with the mysterious MechaLion Galeon...

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:27.540
Who in fact are they?

00:07:29.840 --> 00:07:31.330
Good morning, team!

00:07:32.180 --> 00:07:33.270
Mornin'!

00:07:36.480 --> 00:07:37.510
Professor...

00:07:37.650 --> 00:07:39.670
I wonder if you could possibly make a quieter entrance next time?

00:07:39.850 --> 00:07:41.580
Yes, sorry about that, Chief!

00:07:41.690 --> 00:07:44.660
These Jet Rollers are a little hard to control...

00:07:45.920 --> 00:07:47.550
So what's up with Galeon?

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:49.720
I'm going to show you on the main display...

00:07:53.730 --> 00:07:56.130
You mean he's shattered his chains?

00:07:56.340 --> 00:07:58.670
After not moving a muscle for two years?

00:07:58.770 --> 00:08:00.740
It looks like he's trying to get out.

00:08:00.840 --> 00:08:02.030
But where would he be headed?

00:08:02.140 --> 00:08:03.470
That would be Garbage Island.

00:08:03.610 --> 00:08:06.070
Is that you, Hyuuma? Don't you know there was an emergency call?

00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:07.040
Where are you?

00:08:07.480 --> 00:08:09.540
There's no time to lose, Chief.

00:08:09.650 --> 00:08:10.910
I'm flying over Tokyo Bay now.

00:08:11.020 --> 00:08:13.610
I'm about to send you some video. Get ready to be blown away!

00:08:17.590 --> 00:08:18.920
What in the world is that?

00:08:20.460 --> 00:08:23.760
Most likely, it's the same type as the one that struck two years ago...

00:08:26.100 --> 00:08:28.760
He looks like he's made of trashed electronics!

00:08:28.970 --> 00:08:31.330
Everyone! On the boat, now!

00:08:34.210 --> 00:08:35.760
Teacher!

00:08:38.240 --> 00:08:42.270
There's a 79.6% chance that he'll compromise that gate within an hour!

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:46.940
Chief, we should release Galeon.

00:08:47.050 --> 00:08:48.780
Apparently we have no other choice...

00:08:49.150 --> 00:08:52.610
Prepare the Triple-decked Flying Carrier for launch and open Gate 3!

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:53.910
Roger!

00:08:56.630 --> 00:08:58.860
Launching the Triple-decked Flying Carrier!

00:08:58.960 --> 00:09:01.730
All staff are to evacuate immediately!

00:09:35.470 --> 00:09:37.400
Help!

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:39.570
Is that Hana?

00:09:39.810 --> 00:09:41.470
Can't hang on anymore!

00:09:41.770 --> 00:09:42.900
I'm going to fall!

00:09:43.010 --> 00:09:44.030
Hana!

00:09:44.240 --> 00:09:45.300
Watch it, Mamoru!

00:09:45.410 --> 00:09:47.570
Ushi, you're gonna fall!

00:09:48.410 --> 00:09:49.540
Hold up!

00:09:49.650 --> 00:09:52.580
How could you make a lady do such a thing?

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:54.810
Hana!

00:09:55.650 --> 00:09:56.920
Just in time!

00:09:57.060 --> 00:09:59.960
Don't just hang there! Get yourselves back up here!

00:10:00.090 --> 00:10:02.150
Huh? Where are we?

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:09.260
As far as we can tell from the satellite images...

00:10:09.370 --> 00:10:11.100
...the entire boat seems to have been captured.

00:10:11.270 --> 00:10:13.130
Along with 5 kids...

00:10:13.270 --> 00:10:14.830
This can't be happening...

00:10:15.040 --> 00:10:16.370
Hyuuma here.

00:10:16.510 --> 00:10:19.440
The other survivors have all been rescued...

00:10:21.410 --> 00:10:22.350
This isn't good!

00:10:22.450 --> 00:10:24.280
They've scrambled some Self-Defense Force jets!

00:10:48.970 --> 00:10:51.880
That was a charged particle blast using a microwave cluster.

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:56.340
If that robot reaches Tokyo...

00:10:58.680 --> 00:11:00.310
...the capital will be destroyed!

00:11:13.300 --> 00:11:13.820
What the...

00:11:15.100 --> 00:11:16.360
It's a barrier system!

00:11:37.190 --> 00:11:40.250
What was that? It's not the first time...

00:11:40.630 --> 00:11:43.190
I've seen that lion somewhere...

00:11:53.870 --> 00:11:56.860
A tour boat has become lodged in the rear section of...

00:11:56.970 --> 00:11:59.270
...the mysterious robot that appeared in Tokyo Bay...

00:11:58.150 --> 00:12:01.660
Live from the heart of the new
Tokyo water front

00:11:58.150 --> 00:12:01.870
Mysterious Entity!
Now approaching Tokyo!

00:11:59.380 --> 00:12:02.540
It appears that several students on a field trip are trapped inside.

00:12:01.660 --> 00:12:01.740
Live from the heart of the new
Tokyo water front

00:12:01.870 --> 00:12:01.990
Mysterious Entity!
Now approaching Tokyo!

00:12:02.710 --> 00:12:04.180
Mamoru!

00:12:08.050 --> 00:12:10.350
Two jets scrambled by the Self Defense Force...

00:12:10.450 --> 00:12:13.720
...along with a gigantic lion robot, also of unknown origin...

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:15.510
The lion shaped robot that was shot down

00:12:13.820 --> 00:12:15.490
...were shot down after an attack.

00:12:16.330 --> 00:12:17.990
Wait, that's the lion from...

00:12:20.700 --> 00:12:21.720
Chief!

00:12:21.970 --> 00:12:23.400
What's the matter, Ushiyama?

00:12:23.530 --> 00:12:26.830
One of the kids trapped on that boat is my little brother!

00:12:26.940 --> 00:12:27.530
What?

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:30.870
Go away! Go away!

00:12:30.980 --> 00:12:34.540
Hey! The Self-Defense Force can't attack with the kids there, can they?

00:12:34.610 --> 00:12:36.140
Even if they did attack...

00:12:36.250 --> 00:12:39.440
...they wouldn't have the firepower to crack that robot's barrier system.

00:12:39.780 --> 00:12:41.840
There's only one person who could slip through...

00:12:41.950 --> 00:12:43.890
...that barrier system and rescue those children...

00:12:50.230 --> 00:12:52.020
Right! Utsugi, send in Gai!

00:12:52.130 --> 00:12:53.060
Yes, sir!

00:12:53.200 --> 00:12:55.560
Mobile Unit on standby, do you read me?

00:12:55.700 --> 00:12:57.220
Loud and clear.

00:12:57.570 --> 00:13:00.040
You've kept me on hold way too long, Mikoto.

00:13:00.200 --> 00:13:02.640
Sorry. Do you have sufficient energy?

00:13:04.070 --> 00:13:05.700
Affirmative. I've got a full tank!

00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:06.830
And you know what you have to do?

00:13:06.940 --> 00:13:08.430
Rescue those kids, right?

00:13:08.550 --> 00:13:10.010
We're counting on you, Gai!

00:13:10.410 --> 00:13:12.140
Just leave it to me!

00:13:12.480 --> 00:13:13.810
DrillGao!

00:13:22.190 --> 00:13:24.630
Equip!

00:13:37.440 --> 00:13:40.000
Stay away! Stay away! Stay away!

00:13:43.080 --> 00:13:44.480
I've come to save you guys!

00:13:44.620 --> 00:13:47.410
Whoa! Hey, mister, you're so cool!

00:13:47.480 --> 00:13:49.880
Hey, come on, don't go calling me mister.

00:13:50.150 --> 00:13:52.090
I'm still only 20 years old, you know!

00:13:52.560 --> 00:13:54.180
Come on, guys, let's get you out of here!

00:13:54.390 --> 00:13:55.150
Yes, sir!

00:13:55.260 --> 00:13:56.850
We're saved!

00:13:57.860 --> 00:13:58.730
What's this?

00:14:00.860 --> 00:14:02.700
Hey, mister!

00:14:18.380 --> 00:14:19.140
What the...

00:14:23.220 --> 00:14:24.480
Did it just transform?

00:14:29.190 --> 00:14:31.130
It's just like what happened two years ago.

00:14:34.970 --> 00:14:38.490
From here on in, that entity shall be referred to as EI-02.

00:14:44.610 --> 00:14:46.670
EI-02 has entered the commuter rail system...

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:48.510
...and is headed toward the downtown area.

00:14:53.050 --> 00:14:55.520
EI-02 will reach Shinjuku Station in three minutes.

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:58.750
Sending out evacuation orders to all within a 10km radius!

00:14:59.420 --> 00:15:01.690
But why is it heading downtown?

00:15:09.400 --> 00:15:10.770
The bullet train?

00:15:12.770 --> 00:15:16.600
Sorry, but as far as speed goes, you can't touch LinerGao!

00:15:24.580 --> 00:15:28.210
Galeon's thaw rate has reached 81.2% thanks to internal heat generation...

00:15:28.320 --> 00:15:29.620
He's ready to mobilize!

00:15:29.790 --> 00:15:32.420
Chief! Could you please have him save my kid brother?

00:15:32.720 --> 00:15:33.880
Yes, I hear you!

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:36.350
Professor, what are the odds of a successful Fusion?

00:15:36.490 --> 00:15:41.330
99.9% in simulation mode, but as we don't have any actual field data...

00:15:41.470 --> 00:15:43.090
We're not going to know unless we try.

00:15:45.240 --> 00:15:46.900
Fusion, approved!

00:15:47.100 --> 00:15:48.830
Gai, you've been cleared for Fusion!

00:15:48.910 --> 00:15:50.310
That's what I've been waiting to hear!

00:16:22.040 --> 00:16:24.270
It's going to smash up the Metropolitan Government Office!

00:16:32.550 --> 00:16:33.950
It's that lion again!

00:16:34.050 --> 00:16:35.680
So he survived!

00:16:35.790 --> 00:16:37.150
And there's that old guy, too!

00:16:37.290 --> 00:16:39.080
So he survived!

00:16:45.200 --> 00:16:47.760
Fusion!

00:16:57.910 --> 00:16:59.710
GaiGar!

00:17:01.710 --> 00:17:04.980
The cyborg, Gai, transforms into the mechanoid GaiGar...

00:17:05.080 --> 00:17:08.020
...by achieving fusion with Galeon.

00:17:13.020 --> 00:17:14.550
StealthGao!

00:17:22.670 --> 00:17:24.070
Oh, look! Over there!

00:17:38.550 --> 00:17:39.240
You're slow!

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:51.690
Hooray! We're saved!

00:17:56.770 --> 00:17:58.430
Hey, thanks, mister!

00:17:58.900 --> 00:18:00.300
Stop calling me mister.

00:18:00.400 --> 00:18:02.270
I'm still only 20...

00:18:15.150 --> 00:18:17.050
Hey, this looks really bad!

00:18:21.930 --> 00:18:25.190
GaiGar is signaling for you to authorize Final Fusion!

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:26.350
Professor!

00:18:26.600 --> 00:18:27.720
But, Chief...

00:18:27.860 --> 00:18:32.560
The probability of achieving Final Fusion is close to zero.

00:18:32.700 --> 00:18:35.370
Success rates are no more than target numbers.

00:18:35.510 --> 00:18:37.530
A courageous heart will make up for the rest!

00:18:38.240 --> 00:18:40.610
Final Fusion, approved!

00:18:40.710 --> 00:18:41.700
Yes, sir!

00:18:41.850 --> 00:18:43.280
Final Fusion...

00:18:43.410 --> 00:18:45.570
Program Drive!

00:18:48.820 --> 00:18:50.220
Here we go!

00:18:53.960 --> 00:18:57.980
Final Fusion!

00:19:51.210 --> 00:19:55.810
GaoGaiGar!

00:19:55.920 --> 00:20:00.480
At last the true hero we've been waiting for has been born.

00:20:00.590 --> 00:20:05.320
And his name is GaoGaiGar, the King of Braves!

00:20:09.670 --> 00:20:11.360
Final Fusion complete!

00:20:13.340 --> 00:20:14.960
We're counting on you, Brave One!

00:20:23.750 --> 00:20:26.650
Protect Shade!

00:20:35.430 --> 00:20:37.480
Destruction rate to the barrier system, zero.

00:20:37.590 --> 00:20:38.890
It's completely unscathed!

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:40.330
What the...

00:20:40.430 --> 00:20:42.960
I'm not finished yet!

00:20:46.340 --> 00:20:48.830
Broken Magnum!

00:20:54.040 --> 00:20:59.110
Destruction rate to the barrier system, 20, 25, 35, 50!

00:20:59.250 --> 00:21:01.440
All right! Let's pulverize that thing!

00:21:09.360 --> 00:21:11.090
All right!

00:21:26.040 --> 00:21:28.940
No! It's going to regenerate within 10 seconds!

00:21:30.380 --> 00:21:31.150
Okay, you asked for it!

00:21:31.100 --> 00:21:32.370
Okay, you asked for it!

00:21:32.520 --> 00:21:35.710
Hell and Heaven!

00:21:40.120 --> 00:21:42.720
Gemu, Giru, Gan, Go, Gufo...

00:22:15.460 --> 00:22:18.760
Stop it!

00:22:21.500 --> 00:22:22.490
Huh?

00:22:23.200 --> 00:22:27.900
You can't destroy that!

00:22:39.120 --> 00:22:41.780
Who in the world is that boy?

00:22:46.450 --> 00:22:50.350
You come floating down onto my planet.

00:22:51.550 --> 00:22:55.220
That's the dream I always have.

00:22:56.620 --> 00:23:01.400
Now you're looking up at the sky again...

00:23:01.400 --> 00:23:06.190
and you're searching for me.

00:23:06.820 --> 00:23:10.360
Longing to see you and be with you...

00:23:11.530 --> 00:23:17.290
I know I feel it just as strongly as you.

00:23:19.350 --> 00:23:24.050
Give us the wings to fly

00:23:24.050 --> 00:23:28.710
and set off into the galaxy.

00:23:29.400 --> 00:23:34.050
When you and I are grown up...

00:23:34.050 --> 00:23:40.950
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:23:45.650 --> 00:23:48.450
Now releasing the latest intelligence.

00:23:48.550 --> 00:23:50.680
The core that was ripped from the enemy robot...

00:23:50.790 --> 00:23:52.120
What exactly is it?

00:23:52.250 --> 00:23:54.650
But there's no time to panic before a new enemy emerges...

00:23:54.760 --> 00:23:56.590
...shattering the peace of the city.

00:23:57.190 --> 00:23:59.020
GaiGar is suddenly unable to transform...

00:23:59.160 --> 00:24:01.760
Will the Goddess of Victory smile upon him?

00:24:02.670 --> 00:24:04.930
Next episode of GaoGaiGar, the King of Braves...

00:24:05.030 --> 00:24:06.700
"The Boy With Green Hair"

00:24:06.770 --> 00:24:06.810
The Boy With Green Hair

00:24:06.800 --> 00:24:10.430
Make sure you stay tuned for the order..."Final Fusion Approved!"

00:24:12.920 --> 00:24:15.930
Drill Arm Mode

00:24:13.530 --> 00:24:15.100
This is the Key to Victory!
